<div style="background-color: {{ section.settings.bg_color }}; padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px; padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;">
  <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;">
    {%- if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' -%}
      <p style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 16px;text-align:center;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.8;color:#444;">Andromeda creates <strong>mulberry silk sleep masks</strong> in Grade 6A, 22 momme — the most demanding standard on the market. Our mask offers total blackout thanks to its 22 momme density, is gentle on skin and hair, and adapts to all face shapes with its adjustable elastic. Designed for discerning sleepers, it transforms every night into a true <strong>luxury sleep ritual</strong>. Carefully packaged delivery across France and internationally.</p>
      <p style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 16px;text-align:center;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.8;color:#444;">The <strong>mulberry silk sleep band</strong> protects hair from pillow friction while keeping the mask in place, completing the evening ritual without compromising on comfort.</p>
      <p style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 16px;text-align:center;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.8;color:#444;">Mulberry silk <strong>scrunchies</strong>, 22 momme, round out the hair care routine: less breakage, less frizz, a softness that lasts wash after wash, day and night.</p>
      <p style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.8;color:#444;">Every Andromeda piece is designed in Paris, crafted from Grade 6A mulberry silk — among the rarest 5% of global production — and delivered in a gift box with access to a dedicated sound space for falling asleep.</p>
    {%- else -%}
      {{ section.blocks | map: 'settings' | map: 'text' | join: '' }}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SEO Text",
  "settings": [
    {"type": "color", "id": "bg_color", "label": "Couleur fond", "default": "#FAFAF8"},
    {"type": "range", "id": "padding_top", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "label": "Padding haut", "default": 40},
    {"type": "range", "id": "padding_bottom", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "label": "Padding bas", "default": 40}
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Texte SEO",
      "settings": [
        {"type": "html", "id": "text", "label": "Contenu"}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 1,
  "presets": [{"name": "SEO Text"}]
}
{% endschema %}